Description: plasma: Learn from Stereo KWin when a window's elements may show depth
 .
 With libstereo-declare 1.5 or later, the Plasma platform follows each
 window's surface: Stereo KWin says whether the elements inside the window
 may be shown in depth now (the window is on a stereo output and awake,
 not lying flat behind the active one) and which of its edges lie on the
 output's edge, and Union looks at its depths again whenever that changes.
 Without the library, or on X11, no window is awake and Union draws as
 before.
 .
 libstereo-declare 1.5 and the protocol version it binds are still to be
 written; this is the side Union needs from them.
